WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
Why is he here? Who am I? What am I doing?

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:09,970
Why am I here suddenly? Can you please come in, auntie?

3
00:00:10,330 --> 00:00:11,690
I heard that my uncle was hospitalized

4
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:12,730
Just come and have a look

5
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:16,010
I brought some chicken soup made at home to my uncle, which was very filling.

6
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:17,690
I hope uncle will recover soon

7
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:22,450
My son now brings cabbage home, Xiao Zi

8
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:23,650
The girl is here

9
00:00:23,770 --> 00:00:25,330
You don’t even know how to say hello, sit down and pour water.

10
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:26,450
Just standing there stupidly

11
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:29,850
Where is the girl from? She belongs to the Su family.

12
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:31,170
Live here now

13
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:32,760
good boy

14
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:38,390
With your father and my demeanor back then, sir, you can't do this.

15
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:40,550
Girls need to communicate more

16
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:42,980
You can't be so passive all the time, sister.

17
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,500
Will be settled soon

18
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:46,520
Take Miss Pei down for a walk

19
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,430
two people together

20
00:00:48,630 --> 00:00:50,190
You don’t have to go to a mall restaurant

21
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:51,510
Even if it’s just a walk

22
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:53,070
Talking is enough

23
00:00:53,270 --> 00:00:59,060
After all, he is an assistant assigned by the state. Shu Wan is so good at even this.

24
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:00,500
Do we want

25
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:08,630
Go down and take a walk, yes, yes, yes

26
00:01:08,950 --> 00:01:10,950
I'm bored here all the time. Let's go.

27
00:01:11,110 --> 00:01:12,270
breath of fresh air
